Package: @PACKAGE@
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mikai local QA build <noreply@localhost>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Section: video
Priority: optional
Description: Mikai Ja Nai desktop client for the Mikai anime catalogue
 Mikai Ja Nai browses the public Mikai catalogue and plays provider streams or local
 files through libmpv. Anime4K shader presets and a frame-comparison workspace
 are optional; ordinary playback does not need AI components.
 .
 This package carries its own Qt 6.12 runtime and the Mikai libmpv fork
 (under /usr/lib/mikai/mpv) because no current distribution ships either.
 Optional native inference components are not included.
